# Caddy in front of the Nippes Nights container (docker run -p 127.0.0.1:2567:2567 ...).
# The container port stays private: the server takes the client address for its per-address join limit from the
# X-Forwarded-For header, which Caddy sets. WebSockets (the game connection) pass through reverse_proxy without any
# further configuration. The server serves its own pre-compressed .br/.gz files; Caddy only compresses what is left.
nippes.example.org {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:2567
}
